I finish my work at the office.
I say to Rohan, "See you tomorrow."
Then I step outside the office building.
Outside, the weather is suddenly different.
There is no harsh sunshine in the sky now.
The sunlight is also gone.
I look at the sky.
Dark clouds are rolling in everywhere in the sky.
The clouds are very thick.
Suddenly, a cool wind blows.
I feel the cool wind.
Now it is not hot.
The weather is very pleasant.
I remember the morning forecast.
It will rain in the evening.
That forecast is true.
Soon, it will rain here.
I am very happy.
I look at those dark clouds and smile softly.
